 "strings": {
  "Oh! Are you sure? That'd be amazing! Where should we meet up?": "",
  "How about Theater Square?": "",
  "Okay! I'll be on my way!": "",
  "I appreciate you going to such great lengths to rescue me. The police were saying it was incredible you even found me at all.": "",
  "You were so cool, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I'm just glad you're safe.": "",
  "You're not hurt at all?": "",
  "Thanks. Ugh, if you hadn't come along... I don't even wanna think about that.": "",
  "Only a little... my neck and my wrists were all tied up...": "",
  "But it's no big deal. And I appreciate your concern!": "",
  "Were you hurt at all?": "",
  "Nah, I'm fine. I'm used to that sort of thing.": "",
  "I'm glad to hear that.": "",
  "Are you taking any time off work?": "",
  "Actually, thanks to you, I ended up safe without a scratch. I hardly even need to!": "",
  "Okay. Well, don't push yourself.": "",
  "Are you sure you don't need to rest?": "",
  "Oh, I got this! Working helps me forget all the bad things lol": "",
  "Are you sure you don't need time to recuperate?": "",
  "I'm fine! I'd feel better working anyway.": "",
  "Okay. But don't push yourself.": "",
  "I won't! Thanks for your concern.": "",
  "What are you up to right now?": "",
  "How've you been?": "",
  "Hey, what are you up to right now?": "",
  "Oh, just eating! I'm on break right now.": "",
  "Okay. Hope I'm not bothering you.": "",
  "No, not at all! Lol you're so modest.": "",
  "Hey, just wanted to say hope you're doing well.": "",
  "Thanks! I am back and better than ever!": "",
  "I'm sure my boss appreciates that lol": "",
  "What are you doing right now, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Work.": "",
  "Working on a case?": "",
  "Yeah, something like that.": "",
  "I bet you're able to solve those cases in the blink of an eye!": "",
  "I'm pretty quick like that.": "",
  "Slow and steady wins the race.": "",
  "Yeah, I'm pretty quick like that. Don't wanna let things drag on.": "",
  "Lol I am the exact same way.": "",
  "Nah, I'm going at a snail's pace. Slow and steady wins the race, you know?": "",
  "I suppose there's a time and a place to conserve your energy.": "",
  "Being bored. I was actually thinking of taking a nap.": "",
  "Lol must be nice.": "",
  "I'm gathering up my power.": "",
  "I'm probably gonna die of boredom.": "",
  "Yep. I'm gathering up my power.": "",
  "Your power?": "",
  "Yeah. I rest as much as I can to save up energy for the important jobs.": "",
  "I see! So it's important for you to have downtime!": "",
  "Yeah. Otherwise I might actually die from boredom.": "",
  "Haha, I know that feeling. That's why I keep myself occupied.": "",
  "(Should I text Nanami-san?)": "",
  "Yagami-san. If at all possible, I'd like to thank you for helping me.": "",
  "Ah, don't worry about it.": "",
  "But I have to! You saved my life! Please, tell me if there's anything I can do!": "",
  "Then let's go out on a date.": "",
  "Buy me some food?": "",
  "You want to go out? With me? lol": "",
  "Then let's go out to eat somewhere!": "",
  "How about you buy me a meal and we'll call it even?": "",
  "Are you sure that's all you want?": "",
  "Okay then. I'm free right now, are you?": "",
  "Sorry, I'm a little busy right now. Can I get back to you later?": "",
  "Sure! I'll be waiting for your text!": "",
  "I am too, actually.": "",
  "Great! Then where should we meet up? Would Theater Square be a good spot?": "",
  "Yeah, I think so. I'll wait for you in front of the arcade, then.": "",
  "Okay! I'll be on my way in just a bit!": "",
  "Can't wait!": "",
  "See you there.": "",
  "Can't wait to see you!": "",
  "Haha, likewise!": "",
  "Sorry about today, Yagami-san. My friend got the totally wrong idea about us.": "",
  "I thought it was a good idea.": "",
  "I don't mind.": "",
  "No worries. I didn't mind one bit.": "",
  "Thanks for understanding.": "",
  "Hey, I thought it was a good idea. It's an honor to be mistaken as your boyfriend, Nanami-san.": "",
  "Flattery won't get you anywhere, you know =P": "",
  "I'll tell Yukko it was all a misunderstanding.": "",
  "Okay. Oh, and thanks for today.": "",
  "Of course. I'm glad I could make it up to you, at least in a small way.": "",
  "Let's hang out again.": "",
  "How about another date?": "",
  "How about we hang out again? Not as a thank-you this time.": "",
  "Sure! As long as I have time, I'd be happy to see you again!": "",
  "Then hopefully this was the first date of many.": "",
  "Maybe =P As long as I'm not the first girl of many.": "",
  "Hey, I'm not that kind of guy.": "",
  "Really? Well then maybe we should try and match our schedules lol": "",
  "Text her.": "",
  "Don't bother.": "",
  "(Okay, let's do this.)": "",
  "(What should I say?)": "",
  "(No, not right now.)": "",
  "What have you been up to?": "",
  "Hey, how've you been?": "",
  "I've been doing well, thanks! Work is busy as usual, though.": "",
  "Hey, what have you been up to?": "",
  "Just work as usual. But it's going pretty well, I'd say.": "",
  "What about you? Are you busy these days?": "",
  "More or less. I'm actually looking for stuff to do.": "",
  "Are you now?": "",
  "(Should I ask her out on a date?)": "",
  "Ask her out.": "",
  "Quit while you're ahead.": "",
  "Maybe we can hang out again if you're free?": "",
  "Sure thing! I'd love to!": "",
  "If you're free, maybe we can hang out again?": "",
  "Sorry, but there's a deadline coming up for this huge project I've been working on.": "",
  "I'll make it up to you sometime, okay?": "",
  "Nice hearing from you!": "",
  "(Aww man. I know she's busy and all, but... dang!)": "",
  "(I guess I can always text her later.)": "",
  "Don't do it.": "",
  "Do it anyway.": "",
  "(No, not today.)": "",
  "(Yeah, why not?)": "",
  "Hello there, Nanami-san. It's me. Yagami.": "",
  "Lol are you okay?": "",
  "Only if you are.": "",
  "Of course I am. Just thought I'd remind you I'm still alive.": "",
  "Has it really been that long?": "",
  "A little. Business as usual, Nanami-san?": "",
  "Actually, today was a little slower than usual.": "",
  "You know what I did? I went to the park and had myself a bento! It was great!": "",
  "Sounds like you had a nice little time.": "",
  "I did! I should probably do this more often.": "",
  "Only if you are. I know what a busy lady you can be.": "",
  "Don't I know it... Work hasn't really changed much, but at least I can take a few days off here and there.": "",
  "(Looks like Nanami-san might have some time to spare. Should I ask her out on a date?)": "",
  "Maybe some other time.": "",
  "When's the next time you're free?": "",
  "I'm free right now lol": "",
  "Really? Then do you wanna go out somewhere?": "",
  "If you're free, then why don't we hang out somewhere?": "",
  "Good idea!": "",
  "(Aww yeah!)": "",
  "Yagami-san, do you remember Yukko? You met her last time.": "",
  "Yeah, your friend, right? What about her?": "",
  "I know she was getting really excited over you... more than a lady probably should. Lol! How about the three of us get together?": "",
  "(Huh? Why not just the two of us...?)": "",
  "Uh, sure.": "",
  "Only if it's just the two of us.": "",
  "I'll come if it's just the two of us, Nanami-san.": "",
  "That'll completely defeat the purpose though!": "",
  "C'mon, why not let her tag along?": "",
  "Fine. Let's do that, then.": "",
  "Sure, sounds good to me.": "",
  "Great! I'm sure Yukko will be ecstatic! ": "",
  "I'll contact you after I talk to Yukko!": "",
  "(Hmm. Three friends meeting up together... Hope this isn't her way of rejecting me.)": "",
  "(Though I guess taking two ladies out on the town is kinda special in its own way.)": "",
  "Yagami-san! Yukko said that she's available any time! When are you free next?": "",
  "I'm free right now.": "",
  "Not for a little while.": "",
  "Sorry, but not for a little while.": "",
  "Okay then. Just let me know whenever's good for you!": "",
  "I'm free right now, actually. Can we meet up where we did last time?": "",
  "Sure! In front of the arcade at Theater Square, right? We'll be waiting!": "",
  "Thank you for meeting up with Yukko today. She was really happy to see you.": "",
  "Did you have a good time, too?": "",
  "Oh, absolutely.": "",
  "Then let's hang out again.": "",
  "Let's hang out, you and me.": "",
  "Sure! I'll make sure to tell Yukko, too!": "",
  "(So Yukko's already included, huh?)": "",
  "Then let's hang out again. Just the two of us.": "",
  "Ahaha. I'll think about it.": "",
  "(Such a dry response...)": "",
  "Thanks for today, Yagami-san!": "",
  "No, thank you. I actually had a really great time.": "",
  "Aww, that's because you're such a fun guy!": "",
  "By the way. I'm pretty sure Nanami's interested in you.": "",
  "You mentioned something like that during the date. Why?": "",
  "Nanami brings you up a lot whenever we talk. She wouldn't talk about you so much if she wasn't interested in you!": "",
  "Besides, I was watching how she acted during the date. It's just a hunch, but I felt something there. Guess you can call it a woman's instinct?": "",
  "But she said she wasn't interested in dating.": "",
  "That's just an excuse so she doesn't get hurt by anyone! She may not look like it, but she's actually pretty sensitive!": "",
  "Really now...": "",
  "Yep! That's why Nanami will never take the first step! Please, just ask her out on a date. I'm sure Nanami will open up her heart if it's with you.": "",
  "Totally! I know she'll say yes!": "",
  "She will?": "",
  "How many times are you gonna ask!? The only thing it takes to unfreeze her frozen heart... is your burning love!": "",
  "I've got plenty of that.": "",
  "But if Nanami still won't budge, you can always give me some of that fire. Heck, I'm hot enough for you as it is!": "",
  "Haha, sure thing.": "",
  "(All right, Nanami-san. Check out this fire pickup line...)": "",
  "Hi! What's up?": "",
  "(Okay, I totally chickened out, but still. Should I ask her on a date?)": "",
  "Do it.": "",
  "Forget it.": "",
  "(No, maybe not right now.)": "",
  "Oh. Just wanted to say hi.": "",
  "Okay...?": "",
  "I was just wondering if you were free. Thought maybe we could go out sometime?": "",
  "Ooh, sorry! Now's not really the best time...": "",
  "Gotcha. No worries, then.": "",
  "Sorry, my schedule's been crazy lately.": "",
  "Booked up on dates?": "",
  "Too many dates, not enough time? Haha.": "",
  "Not even funny! If it's not work, it's my friends, and vice versa!": "",
  "I feel you there.": "",
  "Guess I should've figured as much.": "",
  "Sorry for bugging you.": "",
  "No, I'm sorry for turning you down.": "",
  "(I know she's always hustling, but I wish she'd make a little time for me.)": "",
  "(Time to text Nanami-san.)": "",
  "Wanna hang out somewhere?": "",
  "Wanna grab lunch or dinner?": "",
  "(Okay! I definitely will ask her out for a date this time!)": "",
  "Wanna go have some fun?": "",
  "Wanna grab lunch or dinner? Which would you prefer?": "",
  "(Awesome!)": "",
  "Yeah, sure thing.": "",
  "(So now we play the waiting game...)": "",
  "(...I hope she really does contact me.)": "",
  "(Does that mean she doesn't want me texting her until then?)": "",
  "Hey, what's going on?": "",
  "Sure?": "",
  "Hmm, how about lunch?": "",
  "The thing is, I'm still not sure about my schedule today.": "",
  "Is it okay if I contact you later?": "",
  "(I think now should be good. I'll send Nanami-san a text.)": "",
  "What's your schedule look like?": "",
  "Busy as usual?": "",
  "What does your schedule look like lately? There any time to hang out?": "",
  "Oh, sorry I haven't got back to you! I've been pretty loaded down with work...": "",
  "I have no idea how my schedule looks.": "",
  "Yep! You already know lol": "",
  "I guess that means you don't have time to hang out.": "",
  "Yeah. Sorry about that!": "",
  "(This isn't going anywhere...)": "",
  "(I know Yukko-san said Nanami-san was interested in me, but I'm starting to doubt that.)": "",
  "(...I wonder how to move our relationship forward from here.)": "",
  "(No, probably not for a while. If I keep bugging her, she'll probably just shut me out completely.)": "",
  "(Is there another way to confirm Nanami-san's feelings for me...?)": "",
  "(Nanami-san keeps turning me down even when I ask her directly... Maybe I'll ask Yukko-san for advice.)": "",
  "Ask Yukko-san": "",
  "Never Mind": "",
  "(No. I don't want to make it seem like I'm bothering her.)": "",
  "(I know. Yukko-san might be able to help.)": "",
  "Hey there. Can I ask you something about Nanami-san?": "",
  "Sure, if it's something I can answer.": "",
  "Okay. So I've been asking Nanami-san out on a date several times, but she keeps turning me down. Is that normal for her?": "",
  "She hasn't gone out with you at all? Hmm, that is rather odd.": "",
  "Is it? 'Cause it feels like she's brushing me off.": "",
  "If my hunch is correct, Nanami should be pretty into you.": "",
  "That's why I thought she might want to go out with me, but so far that hasn't happened.": ""
 },
